B.cyh=new A.j("Only new users (\u201cNew Users\u201d) who have a valid CARVO User Account and log in through the CARVO App are eligible to participate in the Super Start Promotion (the \u201cPromotion\u201d or the \u201cSuper Start Promotion\u201d). A New User is a user who has not placed an order on the CARVO Site or App in the past 365 days. You must be logged into your CARVO User Account on the CARVO App to be able to participate in the Promotion. If you have not yet downloaded the CARVO App or created a CARVO User Account, you may download the App for free and create a free CARVO User Account.",null,B.a4O,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
